Fouve
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 20 DEAL {UBI, PEAQIV}
UBI 8 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
UBI 0 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
UBI 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
UBI 10 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
UBI 7 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

PEAQIV 2 FACE_LAST
PEAQIV 6 FACE_LAST
PEAQIV 2 FACE_LAST
PEAQIV 9 FACE_ALL

DAQE 1 FACE_ALL
DAQE 7 FACE_ALL
DAQE 8 FACE_LAST
DAQE 5 FACE_LAST
DAQE 10 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE UBI PEAQIV
SRC Suit {DIAMONDS, CLUBS, HEARTS}
MOVE DAQE PEAQIV
DEST Suit {HEARTS, DIAMONDS}
MOVE_STACK UBI UBI
DEST Empty
DRAW
PILE ANY PEAQIV Empty
$win
PILE ALL DAQE Empty
